Stuff that is needed to build the 1p1e accelerator.

component/
	component with interfaces

edn/
	edn files of the processor and engine_core (kept in madhav systems i.e VLSI seminar room lab server having vivado license).

hsys/
   contains all the hsys files required .

ip/
   contains all the IPs used.

verilog/
   contains verilog files of some units used in design.

vhdl/ & additional vhdl/
	VHDL files of design units.

vhdl_libs/
	contains libraries.

constraints/
    have the constraints (.xdc file)

TESTS/
    contains tests for ethernet and ddr4.

vivado_synth/
    contains compile.tcl for vivado synthesis and bitstream generation of APARAJIT.

docs/
    1p1e figure + relevant docs

copy_vhdl_files.sh
    please ignore


